# Episode 1

INT. TENEMENT FLAT - DAY #1-1#

LIN XIAOYU stands in the doorway with an old suitcase. Inside, WEI ZHEN ladles porridge for his younger siblings without looking up.

WEI ZHEN
So you're the one my father married?

LIN XIAOYU
I'm Lin Xiaoyu. From today, I run this house.

Wei Zhen sets the bowl down hard.

WEI ZHEN
This house doesn't need running.

# Episode 2

EXT. FACTORY GATE - NIGHT #2-1#

Lin waits outside the gatehouse. Wei Zhen wheels his bicycle out, sees her, and turns away.

LIN XIAOYU
I paid your sister's school fees.

He stops.

WEI ZHEN
Who asked you to?
